{"step_index":1599,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T23:18:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nPartial read (lines 1-157 of 157). Showing bytes 0-46080 of 85075 in this line range, truncated at the 46080-byte limit. To read the rest of this line range, call this tool again with the same StartLine and EndLine and ByteOffset=46080.\n1: Created At: 2026-11-25T18:18:22-05:00\n2: Completed At: 2026-11-25T18:18:23-05:00\n3: Command exited with code 0.\n4: \n5: Command output:\n6: === work/text/table_0019be000.json entries: 36888\r\n7:   TEXT HIT: 01344a10 'Body armor is sold at Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~ While equipped, your health is protected from ~b~gunshots~b~ or ~b~explosive damage~b~ until it fully breaks.~n~~n~To manage body armor on the move, hold ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ and press ~INPUT_SELECT_NEXT_WHEEL~ to access it. Select the armor and press ~INPUT_HUD_QUICK_SELECT_QUICK_USE_RDOWN~ to equip or unequip it.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ You can store extra body armor in your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ when purchasing it at Ammu-Nations.'\r\n8:   TEXT HIT: 024e0e25 'So bad news. The Ganado ended up getting totaled.'\r\n9:   TEXT HIT: 02a01b29 \"Powerful revolver with a subtle patriotic design, purchased at Phil's Ammu-Nation in Southside.\"\r\n10:   TEXT HIT: 03da4607 'Gone Fishing'\r\n11:   TEXT HIT: 03f726c6 'Call Joey from your ~b~Contacts ~BLIP_APP_CONTACTS~~b~ or check the engine to tow and repair your vehicle.'\r\n12:   TEXT HIT: 0419f84f '@frickjoey'\r\n13:   TEXT HIT: 048935d2 \"Phil's Ammu-Nation\"\r\n14:   TEXT HIT: 06bf12a2 'Free new styles are available at any salon ~1b~ and a weapon wrap is available at any Ammu-Nation ~2b~'\r\n15:   TEXT HIT: 0e76b2c9 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n16:   TEXT HIT: 10356152 \"Working for Brian will require some gear from Ammu-Nation. Pick up a longarm at Chuck's Tackle & Shot.\"\r\n17:   TEXT HIT: 11a59fbe 'Liberty, Gellhorn, Alderney and Carcer had parachuted down into occupied Europe — either France or an even meeker country — and were immediately captured. They had escaped, killed over 5000 Arschlochkommandos in the process, before getting captured again. This time their prison camp had a fence, which made escape much harder.~n~~n~The Germans had rightfully identified Gellhorn as the main troublemaker, and put him in isolation, hoping to break his spirit. The mad Leonidan, however, soon turned the tables on his captors. Day in and day out, the guards outside his cell were driven mad by the unremitting sound of Gellhorn\\'s frenzied pumping, pausing only now and again for a breathless rendition of \"The Star-Spangled Banner\". When the last prison camp guard had finally succumbed — shrieking \"Nein!\" and shooting himself — Liberty had smartly identified his golden opportunity, commandeering their Übermacht motorbike and making an all-American jump straight through the fence. Loading up on guns, ammunition, explosives, cigars and Bratwurst, they were ready for phase three of the plan.~n~~n~Then there had been the hard and bloody tank battle at Panzerschlong. The surprisingly straightforward bombing of the dam at Wimpfken-Shmimpfken. The humbling moment of near defeat before the triumphant comeback at the compound in Klimaxburg.~n~~n~And then, the pièce de résistance: the final stage of their grand plan to win the war. At its heart, it was deceptively simple: the highest-ranking members of Germany\\'s political and military spheres were to be summoned to a remote château in the hills to attend a lavish dinner party hosted in celebration of the Führer himself. Except the Führer wouldn\\'t be there. Instead, those Krauts would be met by Captain Liberty, his squad, and enough dynamite to blow the Reich to hell and back and then back into hell again.~n~~n~By this point, Liberty\\'s life had almost finished flashing before his eyes. He caught final, fleeting glimpses of buxom French milkmaids with pails of cream, busty German waitresses'\r\n18:   TEXT HIT: 120ad52b 'Buy cosmetic upgrades for 5 sidearms and 5 longarms at Ammu-Nation.'\r\n19:   TEXT HIT: 1e84945c 'By Andrew Matoya~n~~n~With the number of crimes involving firearms steadily climbing across Leonida, gun control advocates are saying enough is enough, pointing to a recent study that reveals there are more guns in circulation in Leonida than people and their pets. However, Carson Perez, who leads the Leonida Senate Committee on Criminal Justice, believes the problem is not too many guns, but too few.~n~~n~Perez took questions on a new initiative he is spearheading, called \\'Guns 4 Gangsters\\', at a press conference held outside Ammu-Nation in Stockyard. \"It\\'s a bold move,\" admitted Perez, \"but we\\'re quietly confident that by enabling more criminals to have more access to firearms, we can significantly lower the number of gun-related crimes across the State.\"~n~~n~Trialing in Vice City, the Guns 4 Gangsters initiative will see galvanized steel boxes containing assorted firearms airdropped into crime hotspots and other sketchy neighborhoods. Perez explained: \"Did you know the best way to stop a kid smoking is to make him smoke and smoke until he\\'s sick? That\\'s what we\\'re doing here. We give every punk a firearm. They start off laughing, pointing the guns, even firing them. But the novelty wears off, they get sick of it, and they move on – just like kids with cigarettes.\"~n~~n~Perez previously sat on the Leonida Senate Committee on Substance Abuse, presiding over a 250% increase in teenage drug addiction for the three years he headed the committee.'\r\n20:   TEXT HIT: 1e9fc125 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n21:   TEXT HIT: 2363def3 'Gear Up'\r\n22:   TEXT HIT: 25b05875 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n23:   TEXT HIT: 25c45e20 \"The Ganado has seen better days. Get it fixed up and a new coat of paint at Joey's mod shop before Lucia's release.\"\r\n24:   TEXT HIT: 29c3ba69 '@PhilsAmmunation'\r\n25:   TEXT HIT: 2a09a6fd 'Complete ~b~Gone Fishing~b~ to unlock.'\r\n26:   TEXT HIT: 2ee76b76 \"Modded '70 Vapid Ganado with a distinctive livery and exposed air filters. Found at a residence near Capri.\"\r\n27:   TEXT HIT: 3071c4d9 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n28:   TEXT HIT: 314d5347 \"Assault rifle with a custom American flag wrap, purchased at Phil's Ammu-Nation in Southside.\"\r\n29:   TEXT HIT: 349c946f 'Just a Scratch'\r\n30:   TEXT HIT: 34cdec35 'Jason takes his Ganado to Joey at Coastal Auto Care for some much-needed repairs.'\r\n31:   TEXT HIT: 3569d4b3 'Ran into Joey at the Rusty. Seems like yr old Ganado was a lifetime ago right?! Man RIP that ride. We all need to grab a beer sometime ~BLIP_EMOJI_BEER~'\r\n32:   TEXT HIT: 3715377e 'Hold ~INPUT_INTERACT_LOCKON_VEH|UrgentPulse~ to look at ~o~Joey~s~'\r\n33:   TEXT HIT: 3767a6e0 '@GhostlyGanado'\r\n34:   TEXT HIT: 387b87ee 'Go to the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s~'\r\n35:   TEXT HIT: 38e1b069 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n36:   TEXT HIT: 3a334655 'While wearing body armor, your health is protected from ~b~gunshots~b~ or ~b~explosive damage~b~ until it fully breaks.~n~~n~Body armor is readily available in stock at Ammu-Nation ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~~n~~n~To manage body armor on the move, hold and release ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ then press ~INPUT_SELECT_NEXT_WHEEL~ Select the armor and press ~INPUT_HUD_QUICK_SELECT_QUICK_USE_RDOWN~ to equip or unequip the armor.'\r\n37:   TEXT HIT: 3c294644 \"If you're wasted or busted by the cops, you'll lose your ~b~pocket cash ~BLIP_STYLE_CASH_TYPE_POCKET~~b~ plus a small BuckMe maintenance fee ~BLIP_APP_PAYMENT~ You'll also lose any unowned weapons, and stash bags you were carrying will most likely be lost.~n~~n~Recover owned weapons from the trunk of your personal vehicle ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ or from an Ammu-Nation weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~~n~~n~To lessen the risk of losing cash, deposit it at an ATM ~BLIP_AMBIENT_ATM~~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Stash bags in your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE_STASH_BAG~ may be lost if you don't escape the cops after hitting a location.\"\r\n38:   TEXT HIT: 4353e33f 'Ammu-Nation'\r\n39:   TEXT HIT: 44c33258 'Just a Scratch'\r\n40:   TEXT HIT: 44c78013 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n41:   TEXT HIT: 460a1456 'Press ~INPUT_INTERACT_LOCKON_POS|UrgentPulse~ to greet Joey'\r\n42:   TEXT HIT: 4742becd 'Go back to the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s~'\r\n43:   TEXT HIT: 47c54321 '~COLOR_PERSONAL~Ganado~s~ repaired'\r\n44:   TEXT HIT: 48a55122 'Owned weapons ~BLIP_AMBIENT_WEAPON|COLOR_PERSONAL~ are purchased from ~b~Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~~b~ around Leonida.~n~~n~Buying a weapon will give it to both Jason and Lucia, and can be modified and equipped independently.~n~~n~If dropped or lost, they can be recovered from your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ or a weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Buying more weapons will expand the range of products offered at Ammu-Nations.'\r\n45:   TEXT HIT: 4b0a8e93 \"'70 Vapid Ganado\"\r\n46:   TEXT HIT: 4d1c5c63 'Ammu-Nation'\r\n47:   TEXT HIT: 4eafe833 \"She thrashed through the water with the speed of a Machairodontinae, climbing onto the land and gripping her weapon as she sprinted toward her prey, which was now on the move with the precision of a Muscardinus avellanarius.~n~~n~She whipped past tree branches, the sharp sting of the bark reminding her that she was alive. For the first time in ice ages, she smiled. She was gaining on her prize, and she could already hear her father's celebratory words. 'Booga ooga unga ooga', she'd hear him say, welcoming her home. As Nathalia leapt up and clicked her heels together in anticipation, she lost her footing.~n~~n~Her legs sprawled out underneath her, sending her flying down the forested hill and toward the edge of a cliff, crashing into trees as she desperately tried to slow herself down. The edge was near, and there was nothing to grab onto. As Nathalia closed her eyes and prayed for a quick end, something, or someone, grabbed her by the arm and pulled her to safety.~n~~n~Nathalia caught her breath and looked up at her savior. To her surprise, she saw those same brown eyes she had been chasing moments before. She lurched forward, pinning the animal down. What she saw was no Mammuthus primigenius, nor was it an Ursus\"\r\n48:   HASH HIT: 4fdf20e8 \"Jason's Keys House\"\r\n49:   TEXT HIT: 5044bf86 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n50:   TEXT HIT: 505db1ce 'Leave the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s~'\r\n51:   TEXT HIT: 51295d55 'Smush! Ganado'\r\n52:   TEXT HIT: 51833110 'Coastal Auto Care'\r\n53:   TEXT HIT: 53071e9a 'You can get ~b~sticky bombs~b~ from Yasmani ~1b~ or by purchasing them at an Ammu-Nation ~2b~'\r\n54:   TEXT HIT: 5628cf48 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n55:   TEXT HIT: 570b9b2b 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n56:   TEXT HIT: 584f2e8a 'Rob the Ammu-Nation'\r\n57:   TEXT HIT: 589f7a58 \"PHIL'S AMMU-NATION~n~The Trigger Happy Reader Discount Saves You Money & Gets You Laid!\"\r\n58:   TEXT HIT: 5cb7db5c 'Gear Up'\r\n59:   TEXT HIT: 5e6f4f53 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n60:   TEXT HIT: 608f8786 'Take your Ganado to Joey at Coastal Auto Care ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_CAR_VINTAGE~ He offered to fix it up.'\r\n61:   TEXT HIT: 6146dfc3 'Talk to Joey'\r\n62:   TEXT HIT: 638bd25d \"'70 Vapid Ganado promoting an abandoned juice bar in Gellhorn.\"\r\n63:   TEXT HIT: 6702db27 'BATTEN DOWN YOUR FOREVER-STYLE~n~You know me; I\\'ve had the same look for nearly 30 years, and I\\'ve had no complaints! However, YOU may want to consider if your style can withstand fending off flesh-eating, irradiated, uptight marauders, because there ain\\'t gonna be no barbers or salons in the after-days. I\\'d recommend getting yourself over to the good folk at Barnacle Beauties in Key Lento and picking a look to last.~n~~n~HOWL FROM THE BOWEL~n~I\\'m a man who\\'s earned his stripes, but time sure comes for everyone. These days eight mango daiquiris and two Marbles Big Balls will run through me like the Kalaga Rapids, so imagine what eating a nuclearized squirrel might do to your insides. Just like I say in the chorus of IBS Blues: \"I\\'da caught a red snapper, but I\\'m stuck on the crapper.\" Bulk buying Abyzmol for your survivalist stash could damn well be the smartest decision you ever made.~n~~n~ROOTIN\\', TOOTIN\\' AND LOOTIN\\'~n~Unless you want to rinse your own precious resources, you\\'d better start honing those safecracking skills. I know the Good Lord tells us, \"Thou shall not steal,\" but I don\\'t remember Him saying much about repossessing the valuables of your disintegrated neighbors. Food, medicine, ammo, pornography, fuel, narcotics: you just don\\'t know what little treats they\\'ve left for you. Get cracking!~n~~n~PACK A RUM PUNCH~n~As I say on my 1982 album, Six-String Six-Shooter: \"I\\'d rather pour liquor than pull a trigger.\" Having said that, I won\\'t hesitate to dual wield a couple Goodwin LMG 6s if that\\'s what it takes to keep my stash of Salty Squid safe from raiders. I strongly suggest you hit up your nearest Ammu-Nation and take advantage of our constitutional lack of gun control while you still can!'\r\n64:   TEXT HIT: 6793906b 'Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~ will offer weapon mods to improve its stats and performance.~n~~n~Attachments include custom grips ~BLIP_WEAPON_MOD_GRIP_ON~ magazines ~BLIP_WEAPON_MOD_MAG_ON~ optics ~BLIP_WEAPON_MOD_SIGHT_ON~ and more. Suppressors and tactical flashlights can be equipped and removed in your loadout. Other attachments can only be managed at an Ammu-Nation.~n~~n~Hold ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ to check your weapon stats and attached mods anytime in your loadout.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Hold ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ with a weapon equipped to quickly compare stats with a found weapon on the ground.'\r\n65:   TEXT HIT: 67a853b3 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n66:   TEXT HIT: 67d3dc55 'Recover owned longarms and manage your loadout from your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ or at an Ammu-Nation weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~'\r\n67:   TEXT HIT: 68fd3b83 'Gone Fishing'\r\n68:   TEXT HIT: 6ada8f29 'Subscribe to GTA+ today and get discounts on all ammo in Ammu-Nations.'\r\n69:   TEXT HIT: 6e2f03cc 'Buy 3 sidearms and 3 longarms from Ammu-Nation.'\r\n70:   TEXT HIT: 70ac6b05 \"Had to get a medium freshwater lure from Phil's Ammu-Nation.\"\r\n71:   TEXT HIT: 71b294b2 'By Rebecca Nollis~n~~n~Port Gellhorn has been rocked by a brutal shootout at local institution the Starlet Motel.~n~~n~Tragedy struck the budget hotel with guests and bystanders cut down in a hail of gunfire. Police say that, given the amount of ammunition expended, casualty figures could have been far higher, but this is small comfort to the surviving residents of the Starlet.~n~~n~Witnesses describe how two suspects were seen leaving, having slain several armed men, with one of the suspects observed shooting the rider of a motorcycle and then stealing the vehicle. While some of the fatalities are believed to have been connected with organized crime, police are still trying to establish their identities.~n~~n~The Starlet Motel has never enjoyed a reputation as a particularly safe establishment. Shunned by families and tourists, its long-term residents have tended to be living on the margins of society.~n~~n~But owner Linda Sykes hopes that the latest mass shooting will mark a turning point for the motel. \"I\\'m truly baffled as to how this happened at my reputable business. I love my guests and treat them like members of the family,\" said five-times divorced Sykes, speaking on the phone from an undisclosed location. \"But surely this now makes the motel the safest in Port Gellhorn, because what are the chances of a shootout like this happening again sometime soon?\"~n~~n~With the motel uninsured due to the criminality of most of the regular clientele, it is up to Sykes to find the funds to pay for repairs. Local contractors estimate the damage to the property could run into the dozens of dollars - a price Linda is reluctant to pay.'\r\n72:   TEXT HIT: 7b60f29a '@JoeyJohnJacobs'\r\n73:   TEXT HIT: 7ec4ae6c \"Phil's Ammu-Nation\"\r\n74:   TEXT HIT: 7f8e0f9b 'Coastal Auto Care'\r\n75:   TEXT HIT: 800cfaea 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n76:   TEXT HIT: 81415fda \"If your vehicle takes enough damage, it will be destroyed and undrivable.~n~~n~If this happens to your personal vehicle it can be recovered. Unowned vehicles can't be recovered and are permanently destroyed.~n~~n~You can call Joey from your Contacts ~BLIP_APP_CONTACTS~ to have your vehicle repaired or delivered.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ If your vehicle lands on its side or roof, approach it and hold ~INPUT_SHOVE~ to try and shove it back onto its wheels.\"\r\n77:   TEXT HIT: 873937b6 'Ammu-Nations only accept cash ~BLIP_STYLE_CASH_TYPE_POCKET~ for minor purchases.'\r\n78:   TEXT HIT: 876fc3d1 'Ammu-Nation'\r\n79:   TEXT HIT: 88041fcc '@JoeyDaDon'\r\n80:   HASH HIT: 8bfe1e9b '(Optional) Recover the cash from the trailer'\r\n81:   TEXT HIT: 8d5a5cbf 'Joey'\r\n82:   TEXT HIT: 8db9b25a 'Citrus Ganado'\r\n83:   TEXT HIT: 8e014532 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n84:   TEXT HIT: 8e4f3f84 'Purchase, modify, and manage your weapons at ~b~Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~~b~ across Leonida.'\r\n85:   TEXT HIT: 92aff97b 'Smush! Ganado'\r\n86:   TEXT HIT: 9355f278 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n87:   TEXT HIT: 942b1dcf 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n88:   TEXT HIT: 955d742e '@SadJoey'\r\n89:   TEXT HIT: 9596aff5 'Mission Blip: Joey'\r\n90:   TEXT HIT: 966f93d2 'Jason heads to his local Ammu-Nation to pick up a longarm gun.'\r\n91:   TEXT HIT: 97553638 'Get your vehicle towed for repairs by calling Joey from your ~b~Contacts ~BLIP_APP_CONTACTS~~b~'\r\n92:   TEXT HIT: 97d1139a 'Leave the water and recover your vehicle by calling Joey.'\r\n93:   TEXT HIT: 99cba602 'A new ~b~Ultimate Edition~b~ unique weapon variant ~BLIP_STYLE_PICKUP_WEAP_COLLECT~ is available at any Ammu-Nation weapon locker.'\r\n94:   TEXT HIT: 99e93a94 'Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~ offer equipment for purchase, such as body armor, ammo packs, and explosives packs.~n~~n~Ammo and explosives packs will be sent to your personal vehicle trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ on purchase. Taking them out of your trunk will refill your equipped weapon ammunition and explosives.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Keep extra equipment in your trunk to restock your supplies on the go or ahead of a job.'\r\n95:   TEXT HIT: 9a62eb65 'Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~ will offer weapon mods to improve its stats and performance.~n~~n~Attachments include custom grips ~BLIP_WEAPON_MOD_GRIP_ON~ magazines ~BLIP_WEAPON_MOD_MAG_ON~ optics ~BLIP_WEAPON_MOD_SIGHT_ON~ and more. Suppressors and tactical flashlights can be equipped and removed in your loadout. Other attachments can only be managed at an Ammu-Nation.~n~~n~Hold and release ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ to check your weapon stats and attached mods anytime in your loadout.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Hold and release ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ with a weapon equipped to quickly compare stats with a found weapon on the ground.'\r\n96:   TEXT HIT: 9acb1db5 \"Bad news. The Ganado was totaled in the fire. Joey took it for scrap. It's still hot down here so keep laying low. You guys alright?\"\r\n97:   TEXT HIT: 9bb8752a \"These vehicles belong to ~b~Coastal Auto Care ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_CAR_VINTAGE~~b~ and can't be stolen.\"\r\n98:   TEXT HIT: 9c1ebfaa 'Lures come in various sizes for both freshwater and saltwater fish.~n~~n~Be sure to choose the right lure for the fish species you want to catch. You can buy fishing lures at certain Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Catching a fish will also add its information and its recommended lure to the ~b~Progress~b~ menu.'\r\n99:   TEXT HIT: 9c903c14 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n100:   TEXT HIT: a49f2f1e 'Coastal Auto Care'\r\n101:   HASH HIT: a5d2a9d0 'Dynamix Fitness'\r\n102:   TEXT HIT: a636a082 'Ammu-Nations'\r\n103:   TEXT HIT: a925a2e7 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n104:   TEXT HIT: a9eeeb19 \"Joey's '65 Dominator\"\r\n105:   TEXT HIT: ab5b5242 'Gear Up'\r\n106:   TEXT HIT: ac5f87bd \"Most Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~ have a weapon locker.~n~~n~Use it to recover owned weapons, manage your loadout, or select weapon variants ~BLIP_STYLE_PICKUP_WEAPON_COLLECTIBLE~~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ You can also move weapons to your personal vehicle's trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ for easier access on the go.\"\r\n107:   TEXT HIT: b3ea6298 \"Chuck's Tackle & Shot~n~Guns & Ammo~n~Tackle & Bait~n~Ammu-Nation\"\r\n108:   TEXT HIT: b57c1d3a 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n109:   TEXT HIT: b70d1a97 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n110:   TEXT HIT: b789cda2 \"~b~Tip:~b~ Unowned weapons will be lost when you're busted or wasted. Purchase weapons at Ammu-Nation to guarantee their safety.\"\r\n111:   TEXT HIT: b86e0ef2 'Ammu-Nation'\r\n112:   TEXT HIT: bd50d4a7 'Spend over $50,000 at Ammu-Nations.'\r\n113:   TEXT HIT: bd65dc15 'Citrus Ganado'\r\n114:   TEXT HIT: c1cf23c9 \"Hey this is Joey from Coastal Auto Care. Cal mentioned your car might need some work, let me know. Here's my spot.\"\r\n115:   TEXT HIT: c73e952c \"Phil's Ammu-Nation\"\r\n116:   TEXT HIT: c7f1b067 'Ammu-Nations'\r\n117:   TEXT HIT: c8895c73 'Cal has left a surprise for Jason with Joey. Speak with him at his garage in Key Lento.'\r\n118:   TEXT HIT: c96fdf7f \"Hold ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ to open your loadout.~n~~n~You can carry ~b~two sidearms~b~ and ~b~two longarms~b~ in your loadout at one time. There is also room for explosives, a melee weapon, and equipment like binoculars and a flashlight.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Manage your loadout and swap weapons at a weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~ in an Ammu-Nation, or use your personal vehicle's trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~\"\r\n119:   TEXT HIT: cb84df29 \"'70 Ganado\"\r\n120:   TEXT HIT: cc31ef42 'Gear Up'\r\n121:   TEXT HIT: d22eff87 'Ammu-Nation'\r\n122:   TEXT HIT: d244cb70 'Just a Scratch'\r\n123:   TEXT HIT: d273288b 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n124:   TEXT HIT: d2d08f7e \"I remember you telling me you used to drive a Phoenix right? I hope so cause... fuck it just go to Joey's and collect your surprise. ~BLIP_EMOJI_DEVIL_RED~\"\r\n125:   TEXT HIT: d5036352 \"Purchase new weapons, equipment, and mods at any Ammu-Nation ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~~n~~n~Owners will notice if you buy up a lot of their stock. They'll eventually expand their range of products and some higher-end items will become available for purchase.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Larger stores will sell a wider range of weapons and offer exclusive cosmetic options.\"\r\n126:   TEXT HIT: d5c6c443 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n127:   TEXT HIT: d7856045 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n128:   TEXT HIT: d7a1dd9d '~b~Coastal Auto Care~b~ offers a variety of custom retro mods ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_CAR_VINTAGE~'\r\n129:   TEXT HIT: d882639d '~b~Ultimate Edition~b~ weapons are now available. Pick them up from your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ or at an Ammu-Nation ~1b~ weapon locker.'\r\n130:   TEXT HIT: d912db47 'Just a Scratch'\r\n131:   TEXT HIT: e1f6fbf3 \"You're out of gas. Call Joey from your ~b~Contacts~b~ ~BLIP_APP_CONTACTS~ to request a tow and fuel up your vehicle.\"\r\n132:   TEXT HIT: e2c858fa 'Hold and release ~INPUT_INTERACT_LOCKON_VEH|UrgentPulse~ to look at ~o~Joey~s~'\r\n133:   TEXT HIT: e3c25cdc '~b~Ammu-Nations~b~ sell guns, mods, ammo, and more.'\r\n134:   TEXT HIT: e48c934a 'Just a Scratch'\r\n135:   TEXT HIT: e4d917af \"Hey this is Joey from Coastal Auto Care. Cal mentioned your car might need some work, let me know. Here's my spot.\"\r\n136:   TEXT HIT: e8f0f4ec '~b~Tip:~b~ Use a weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~ at an Ammu-Nation to recover owned weapons and manage your loadout.'\r\n137:   TEXT HIT: eaa187b3 'A new ~b~Ultimate Edition~b~ unique weapon variant ~BLIP_STYLE_PICKUP_WEAP_COLLECT~ is available at any Ammu-Nation weapon locker.'\r\n138:   TEXT HIT: eb7f2e8f 'BENOIT SUCRE — LOS SANTOS\\' AWARD-WINNING PASTRY CHEF — ON HIS FAVORITE RIFLE~n~~n~In my profession, we have a saying: presentation is everything. And that is true even of something as beautiful as the Kozlov KZ-59.~n~~n~Mine has a recipe of modifications for comfort and tactical advantage. 12\" barrel, modern stock, ergonomic grips, large aperture holo sight and a beautiful custom finish. All available at any good Ammu-Nation today!'\r\n139:   TEXT HIT: ec1bc5b6 '~b~Tip:~b~ Call Joey from your ~b~Contacts~b~ ~BLIP_APP_CONTACTS~ to have your vehicle repaired or delivered.'\r\n140:   TEXT HIT: f0090f8e \"Hold and release ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ to open your loadout.~n~~n~You can carry ~b~two sidearms~b~ and ~b~two longarms~b~ in your loadout at one time. There is also room for explosives, a melee weapon, and equipment like binoculars and a flashlight.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ Manage your loadout and swap weapons at a weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~ in an Ammu-Nation, or use your personal vehicle's trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~\"\r\n141:   TEXT HIT: f22c2ff3 'Joey'\r\n142:   TEXT HIT: f46af3cd 'Make an Ammu-Nation Purchase'\r\n143:   TEXT HIT: f613ed62 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n144:   TEXT HIT: f6f98830 \"~BLIP_APP_AI_ASSISTANT~ Generated by WAiNK~n~~n~This appears to be a disused radome on an island in Riquezas Keys, dating back to the mid-20th century. It has likely fallen into disuse since the establishment of the nearby Mile Zero Air Station, a naval base in south Leonida. Are you looking to pay large sums to the United States Military in exchange for easily-revoked commercial property rights here? Potential uses for decommissioned military installations are: as venues for live ammunition military-themed birthday parties, as sites for the United Dads of Leonida's biannual Military Bang Gang fundraiser, and as film sets for military-coded Furry-themed pornography. This list is in ascending order of lucrativeness as outlined in the official US Military Doctrine Manual.\"\r\n145:   TEXT HIT: f7dadd50 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n146:   TEXT HIT: f7deac2b '~b~Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~~b~ will expand their stock as you purchase more weapons.'\r\n147:   TEXT HIT: f9875a2d 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n148:   TEXT HIT: fab575e7 'Coastal Auto Care'\r\n149:   TEXT HIT: fabe8529 'You can manage your loadout in your trunk ~1b~ or any Ammu-Nation ~2b~ ahead of a job.'\r\n150:   TEXT HIT: ffd86b1c 'Ammu-Nation'\r\n151: === work/text/mission_text.json entries: 2\r\n152:   TEXT HIT: missions {'AIR_BEACH': {'AIR_BEACH': 'Cash Injections', 'PROG_AIR_BEACH_DESC_REPLAY': \"Seeing an opportunity to gain Nate's trust, Lucia backs him up on a scheme to sell Synthol on Ocean Beach. Nate says he'll put in a good word with Kordell.\", 'AIR_BEACH_DESC': 'Nate is selling some synthol. Join him on the deal.'}, 'AIR_BUS': {'AIR_BUS': 'Amateur Hour', 'PROG_AIR_BUS_DESC_REPLAY': 'Cisco asks Lucia to help him confront a porn director who owes him money. Seeing a chance to win him over, she accepts.', 'AIR_BUS_DESC': \"Help Francisco get the money he's owed.\"}, 'AIR_CATER': {'AIR_CATER': 'Fully Catered', 'PROG_AIR_CATER_DESC_REPLAY': \"Raul sends Jason and Lucia to steal an airport catering truck for use in the heist. While Raul and Jason fill bags with fake cash to swap out with the bodybuilders' real cash, Raul tells Jason about his son, and cautions him that maybe Tomás is better off without a father like him in his life.\", 'AIR_CATER_DESC': 'Steal the catering truck and deliver it to the drop-off location.'}, 'AIR_CATER_DHF': {'AIR_CATER_DHF': 'Fully Catered'}, 'AIR_CATER_DHP': {'AIR_CATER_DHP': 'Fully Catered'}, 'AIR_CATER_DHS': {'AIR_CATER_DHS': 'Fully Catered'}, 'AIR_DRONE': {'AIR_DRONE': 'Close Surveillance', 'PROG_AIR_DRONE_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Karim use a drone to spy on Nate and Cisco in Ocean Beach. They track them to Omar's apartment, the head of baggage handling at VCIA, where they are intimidating him into giving them access to the airport. Karim then reveals he's decrypted some footage from Jason and Lucia's hard drive - it shows Leonida senator and former pop star Camila Fuentes.\", 'AIR_DRONE_DESC': 'Work with Karim running surveillance on Nate and Francisco, and reveal the identity of their inside man.'}, 'AIR_FINAL': {'AIR_FINAL': 'VCIA Takedown', 'PROG_AIR_FINAL_DESC_REPLAY': \"When Kordell makes his move on the airport, Raul's crew double-cross them and steal the take but it goes far from smoothly. The bodybuilders are all killed, as is Karim. Raul and Lucia crash-land a passenger jet in Vice City Bay while Andrea and Jason get the currency deposits. Afterwards, Raul tells them to lay low, and he'll be in touch once he, Valentina, and Abe have auctioned the hard drive to either Camila Fuentes or Giorgio Gallo.\", 'AIR_FINAL_DESC': 'Work with Raul and his crew to rip off the bodybuilders and steal their take.'}, 'AIR_FINAL_DATA_HACK_FAILED': {'AIR_FINAL_DATA_HACK_FAILED': 'VCIA Takedown'}, 'AIR_FINAL_DATA_HACK_PASSED': {'AIR_FINAL_DATA_HACK_PASSED': 'VCIA Takedown'}, 'AIR_GANG': {'AIR_GANG': 'Dirty Work', 'PROG_AIR_GANG_DESC_REPLAY': \"Lucia has Cisco and Nate on side, but is unable to crack Raina. Andrea organizes a plan where Jason pretends to hire Raina as a dominatrix while Lucia takes photos to sew distrust and compromise Raina's position in Kordell's crew.\", 'AIR_GANG_DESC': 'Set Raina up so Kordell loses trust in her and kicks her off his crew.'}, 'AIR_HACK': {'AIR_HACK': 'Delivery Method', 'PROG_AIR_HACK_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason sneaks into the Transport Security Services building to hack their network and get Lucia's data loaded onto their system. This will help her get through security when she poses as the wine authenticator in Kordell's heist.\", 'AIR_HACK_DESC': \"Infiltrate the TSS offices and plant Lucia's fingerprints in their database.\"}, 'AIR_RECRU': {'AIR_RECRU': 'Team Building', 'PROG_AIR_RECRU_DESC_REPLAY': \"Lucia and Kordell go to an underground fight club where he recruits bodies to help with the heist. Kordell is suspicious of Lucia but saves her when she gets stuck in the fight club. He then takes her to meet Raul, who Cisco has been tailing. After a tense stand off, Raul walks away and Lucia's cover remains intact.\", 'AIR_RECRU_DESC': 'Kordell wants to introduce you to some people.'}, 'AIR_SCOPE': {'AIR_SCOPE': 'Too Much Baggage', 'PROG_AIR_SCOPE_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason works as a baggage handler at Vice City International Airport under the head baggage handler, Omar. While working, he plants some bugs for Karim so he can access the airport's security system.\", 'AIR_SCOPE_DESC': 'Scope out the airport while posing as a worker and help Karim access the network.'}, 'AIR_TAIL': {'AIR_TAIL': 'Heavy Lifting', 'PROG_AIR_TAIL_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Lucia bring Raul the hard drive. Raul's latest plan is to rob a rival crew lead by a bodybuilder he worked with a long time ago called Kordell Grant. Raul believes Kordell's crew are planning a heist of their own and wants Jason and Lucia to gather some intelligence on them at Ajax Gym. They tail the gang and figure out their upcoming heist has something to do with Vice City International Airport. In the meantime, Karim has discovered that the hard drive belonged to Bilgeco shipping heir, Giorgio Gallo.\", 'AIR_TAIL_DESC': 'Tail the armored car crew and gain access to one of their phones.'}, 'AIR_TRAIN': {'AIR_TRAIN': 'Making Gainz', 'PROG_AIR_TRAIN_DESC_REPLAY': \"Lucia gets to know Nate, a bodybuilder and member of Kordell's gang, while working out with him over several weeks and getting into shape. Eventually, she earns an introduction to the rest of Kordell's crew and access to the Trauma Floor - Kordell's private workout area at Ajax Gym.\", 'AIR_TRAIN_DESC': \"Get to know Kordell's crew by working out at the gym.\"}, 'AIR_TRUCK': {'AIR_TRUCK': 'Power Play', 'PROG_AIR_TRUCK_DESC_REPLAY': \"While Lucia works with Kordell's crew on an armored car robbery, Jason finds their plans for the upcoming heist. They intend to sneak into the airport's vault by posing as a wine authenticator then steal the millions' worth of currency deposits kept there. Raul decides they'll secretly help Kordell's team, then swoop in and steal the score from under them.\", 'AIR_TRUCK_DESC': \"Work as a getaway driver for Kordell's crew while Jason searches their place.\"}, 'ANT_CHASE': {'ANT_CHASE': 'Dubious Provenance', 'PROG_ANT_CHASE_DESC_REPLAY': 'When Halifax double-crosses them, Jason and Lucia attempt to take back the statue.', 'ANT_CHASE_DESC': 'Catch up with Halifax and make him explain where the statue is.'}, 'ANT_CHASE_AUTOLAUNCH': {'ANT_CHASE_AUTOLAUNCH': 'Dubious Provenance'}, 'ANT_GIVE': {'ANT_GIVE': 'Dubious Provenance', 'PROG_ANT_GIVE_DESC_REPLAY': 'Jason and Lucia meet with Halifax to hand over the statue for authentication.', 'ANT_GIVE_DESC': 'Go back to the antique store in Capri and speak to Halifax.'}, 'ANT_INTRO': {'ANT_INTRO': 'Dubious Provenance', 'PROG_ANT_INTRO_DESC_REPLAY': \"Lucia and Jason check out an antique store in Capri, looking for info on the statue. The owner, Evelyn, tells them the statue is either an incredible fake or stolen and makes them leave immediately. A British antiquer, Benedict Halifax, catches up to them outside and says he'll appraise the statue off the books - offering his very valuable watch as collateral while he finds out the statue's worth.\", 'ANT_INTRO_DESC': 'Find out what the statue is worth at an antique store in Capri.'}, 'ANT_INTRO_APARTMENT': {'ANT_INTRO_APARTMENT': 'Dubious Provenance'}, 'ANT_INTRO_STORAGE': {'ANT_INTRO_STORAGE': 'Dubious Provenance'}, 'ANT_RECOV': {'ANT_RECOV': 'Dubious Provenance', 'PROG_ANT_RECOV_DESC_REPLAY': 'Jason and Lucia return to the antique store in search of the statue.', 'ANT_RECOV_DESC': 'Evelyn wants to tell you where Halifax kept the item. Meet her at the antique store.'}, 'ANT_SRCH': {'ANT_SRCH': 'Dubious Provenance', 'PROG_ANT_SRCH_DESC_REPLAY': 'Jason and Lucia have lost contact with Halifax, and he still has the statue. They set out to track him down.', 'ANT_SRCH_DESC': 'Now that the shop is closed, search for any sign of Halifax or the statue.'}, 'AO_DEAL_T_SYNTH': {'AO_DEAL_T_SYNTH': 'Take Out Kitty Litter', 'PROG_AO_DEAL_T_SYNTH': 'Kitty Litter Labs', 'PROG_AO_DEAL_T_SYNTH_DESC_REPLAY': \"Tyrone has decided the Kitty Litter operation needs to be shut down - it's killing people across VC and taking away his business. He asks Jason and Lucia to find and destroy a series of labs across Vice City where Kitty Litter is being produced.\", 'AO_DEAL_T_SYNTH_DESC': \"Kitty Litter is taking out Tyrone's customers, and he wants all the synthetics labs producing it destroyed.\"}, 'AO_SHOW_L_EXP': {'AO_SHOW_L_EXP': \"Randy's Wish List\", 'PROG_AO_SHOW_L_EXP_DESC_REPLAY': 'Randy has a list of high-end cars he wants to export. But first, he needs Jason and Lucia to steal them.', 'AO_SHOW_L_EXP_DESC': 'Randy Kozlov provided a list of high-end cars he wants stolen and brought to his showroom.'}, 'BAN_CARTE': {'BAN_CARTE': 'The Missing Link', 'PROG_BAN_CARTE_DESC_REPLAY': \"Andrea has arranged a meet with Monty, a high up La Polilla Negra enforcer at a cockfight in Watson Bay. He makes Andrea and Lucia pose for the cartel's social media, before Andrea attempts to drug him. After a fight, Andrea and Lucia escape with Monty to Vice City, where they and the rest of Raul's crew interrogate him for information by hanging him over an alligator-infested swimming pool.\", 'BAN_CARTE_DESC': 'Find Monty and persuade him to share the information Raul needs.'}, 'BAN_EXPLO': {'BAN_EXPLO': 'Company Property', 'PROG_BAN_EXPLO_DESC_REPLAY': 'Raul has told Brian he owes him a favor after giving Jason and Lucia a place in his crew. In return, Brian arranges to receive a shipment of weapons from his old smuggler contact, Pilot Pete, that Raul needs for his heist. Jason, Lucia, Brian, and Pete are unloading the weapons but are forced to flee when the IAA and cops show up.', 'BAN_EXPLO_DESC': \"Brian's old friend, Pete, is supplying hardware for the job. Collect it for Raul.\"}, 'BAN_FINAL': {'BAN_FINAL': 'The Cartel Heist', 'PROG_BAN_FINAL_DESC_REPLAY': \"With their preparations made, Raul's crew hits the Sinfrontera National Bank. Some time later, Raul calls and says he'll send an advance on their earnings and that he has a suite in the Y Hotel they can move into.\", 'BAN_FINAL_DESC': \"All the planning and preparation is set. Join Raul's crew and rob the Sinfrontera National Bank.\"}, 'BAN_PKBMB': {'BAN_PKBMB': 'Hidden Charges', 'PROG_BAN_PKBMB_DESC_REPLAY': 'Jason and Lucia head into the city with Karim to plant explosives in preparation for the Sinfrontera heist.', 'BAN_PKBMB_DESC': 'Karim is coming along to show you where to plant the explosives.'}, 'BAN_RESCU': {'BAN_RESCU': 'Security Expert', 'PROG_BAN_RESCU_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Lucia take Nicole from under the noses of her La Polilla Negra protection detail and bring her to Raul. Raul reveals he knows she's been stealing from Polilla Negra and that they were planning to kill her after her current assignment. Nicole agrees to join Raul's crew.\", 'BAN_RESCU_DESC': 'Kidnap the safe expert and deliver her to Raul.'}, 'BAN_SAFE': {'BAN_SAFE': 'Safe Word', 'PROG_BAN_SAFE_DESC_REPLAY': \"Nicole knows what safe is in Sinfrontera National Bank, but wants Lucia to practice her safe cracking skills. She sends Jason and Lucia to steal a smaller version of the same safe from a pornographer's mansion. After Jason locates the safe, they pull it from the house with a truck and drag it through the streets of Vice City before delivering it to Raul's base of operations.\", 'BAN_SAFE_DESC': \"The practice safe is in a porn mogul's mansion. Get it back to Raul's planning room.\"}, 'BAN_SETUP': {'BAN_SETUP': 'Sinfrontera National Bank', 'PROG_BAN_SETUP_DESC_REPLAY': 'Raul reve